# Explore RAG

```elixir
Mix.install(
  [
    # {:bumblebee, "~> 0.6.0"},
    {:nx, "~> 0.9.0"},
    {:exla, "~> 0.9.0"},
    {:kino, "~> 0.14.0"},
    {:hnswlib, "~> 0.1.5"},
    {:req, "~> 0.5.0"},
    {:kino_bumblebee, "~> 0.5.0"}
  ],
  config: [nx: [default_backend: EXLA.Backend]]
)
```

## References

