* [A RAG for Elixir in Elixir](https://bitcrowd.dev/a-rag-for-elixir-in-elixir/)
* [A RAG Library for Elixir](https://bitcrowd.dev/a-rag-library-for-elixir/?utm_source=elixir-merge)
* [How to use Jina embeddings in Elixir with Bumblebee](https://bitcrowd.dev/how-to-run-jina-embeddings-in-elixir/)
* [Notes on semantic search with Elixir and Bumblebee](https://dev.to/ndrean/an-example-of-semantic-search-with-elixir-and-bumblebee-h9n)
* [Bumblebee -- LLMs and RAG](https://hexdocs.pm/bumblebee/llms_rag.html)
